rtant  that the west isn't soft with the  sanctions that we finally start to see  the tough action that matches the  rhetoric that we've had  from the last few months and we can't  just have a repeat of the last 10 or 10  years when putin's repeatedly taken  actions such as in crimea with the  downing of the mh17 jet with the  scribbles in salisbury and the killing  of dawn sturgis and time after time  after time actually the sanctions that  the west has put on putin has been quite  feeble i think this time we need to show  that we will take all action that we  possibly can so that putin has no choice  but to stop this yeah and in front of  the uh um the eye ukraine's agony uh  another picture there heartbreaking  picture of somebody uh clearly in a lot  of distress but the problem is  russia has nuclear weapons and there's  only so far  we're going to want to push him isn't  that  absolutely and of course he knows that  and he also knows through what happened  with afghanistan for example and the  withdrawal of the american troops and  the failure of anybody to do the right  thing in afghanistan he knows that none  of us want war i mean the people the  people not just of america in our own  country and i think widely do not want  war i think we live in very different  times even from the 80s which obviously  people like me remember when i think  people are under the leadership of say  thatcher and reagan there was more of a  willingness to be that the police  officers of freedom and democracy in the  world and i think a lot of that has now  gone and putin knows all of that and and  my huge fear is that this is indeed part  of a plan i mean after all he has  secured in effect 14 years 14 years more  in power in theory  and although he's 69 he intends to use  those years to execute his plan and i  think you know in the past i think we  all looked at this and i think we were  complacent and i put my hands up as a  member of a government in the last 10  years that we've been too complacent and  when people said oh we got this plan  effectively to reinstate the old soviet  union i think we all boo booed it away i  think it's true i think it's real and  that's why we have got to stand up to  him and we've got to do the right thing  now okay anna john i know you'll stay  with us for the next hour or so thank  you very much for the moment

